---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const heroImage = "/images/astras/part-3-epic-hero.png";

const weaponJourneyItems = [
  { title: "Part I - Astras", href: "/astras/part-1", eyebrow: "Mantra weapons", description: "Weapons invoked through mantra, concentration, discipline, and divine authority.", status: "available" },
  { title: "Part II - Ayudhas", href: "/astras/part-2", eyebrow: "Divine weapons", description: "The eternal weapons carried by the gods, inseparable from their divine identities.", status: "available" },
  { title: "Part III - Epic Weapons", href: "/astras/part-3", eyebrow: "Hero weapons", description: "The legendary weapons of epic heroes, including Gandiva, Kodanda, Vijaya, and Chandrahasa.", status: "available" },
];

const weaponGroups = [
  {
    number: "01",
    title: "Divine Bows",
    note: "The most celebrated bows of the epics, each carrying a unique legacy of valor and Dharma.",
    columns: ["Weapon", "Hero", "Bestowed By / Origin"],
    rows: [
      ["Kodanda", "Rama", "Traditional bow of Rama"],
      ["Gandiva", "Arjuna", "Agni, originally from Brahma through Varuna"],
      ["Vijaya", "Karna", "Given to Parashurama; traditionally associated with Vishvakarma's craftsmanship"],
      ["Shiva Dhanush (Pinaka in the Ramayana tradition)", "Broken by Rama at Sita's svayamvara", "Shiva"],
    ],
  },
  {
    number: "02",
    title: "Legendary Swords",
    note: "Symbols of courage, kingship, and righteous warfare.",
    columns: ["Weapon", "Hero", "Origin"],
    rows: [
      ["Chandrahasa", "Ravana", "Gift from Shiva"],
      ["Asi (in heroic traditions)", "Various kings and warriors", "Primordial sword originating from Brahma"],
    ],
  },
  {
    number: "03",
    title: "Divine Axes",
    note: "Weapons associated with unmatched martial mastery.",
    columns: ["Weapon", "Hero", "Origin"],
    rows: [["Parashu", "Parashurama", "Gift of Shiva"]],
  },
  {
    number: "04",
    title: "Maces and Blunt Weapons",
    note: "Weapons that relied on immense strength, discipline, and mastery of close combat.",
    columns: ["Weapon", "Hero", "Origin"],
    rows: [
      ["Gada", "Bhima", "Mastered under Balarama"],
      ["Gada", "Duryodhana", "Mastered under Balarama"],
      ["Gada", "Hanuman", "Symbol of divine strength and devotion"],
    ],
  },
  {
    number: "05",
    title: "Spears, Lances and Special Weapons",
    note: "Rare weapons bestowed for decisive moments in battle.",
    columns: ["Weapon", "Hero", "Origin"],
    rows: [
      ["Vasavi Shakti", "Karna", "Gift from Indra in exchange for his divine armor and earrings"],
      ["Shakti Spear", "Indrajit", "Divine boon described in Ramayana traditions"],
    ],
  },
  {
    number: "06",
    title: "Sacred Objects and Heroic Implements",
    note: "Some heroes are remembered not only for weapons but also for sacred objects inseparably linked to their deeds.",
    columns: ["Object", "Hero", "Significance"],
    rows: [
      ["Mountain-bearing Strength", "Hanuman", "Carrying the Sanjeevani mountain"],
      ["Mace (Gada)", "Hanuman", "Symbol of unwavering devotion and immense power"],
    ],
  },
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Epic Weapons | Sanatana Path" description="A dedicated atlas page for the legendary weapons of epic heroes, including Kodanda, Gandiva, Vijaya, Chandrahasa, and more." image={heroImage} type="article">
  <article class="weapon-page" style={`--accent:#ff9b58; --warm:#f3c879; --hero-image:url('/images/astras/part-3-epic-hero.png')`}>
    <section class="weapon-hero">
      <div class="hero-glass">
        <a class="back-link" href="/astras">Weapons overview</a>
        <p class="eyebrow">Atlas of Divine Weapons</p>
        <h1>Epic Weapons</h1>
        <strong>Legendary Weapons of the Epic Heroes</strong>
        <p>Not every legendary weapon described in the Hindu epics is an Astra or an Ayudha. Some became sacred through the courage, destiny, and Dharma of the heroes who carried them.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <nav class="weapon-progress" aria-label="Sacred weapons part navigation">
      <div class="progress-head"><span>Part path</span><strong>Sacred Weapons</strong></div>
      <div>{weaponJourneyItems.map((item, index) => <a href={item.href} class:list={["progress-item", item.href === "/astras/part-3" && "active"]} title={item.description}><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span><strong>{item.title}</strong><small>{item.eyebrow}</small></a>)}</div>
    </nav>

    <div class="weapon-layout">
      <div data-reading-body class="weapon-groups">
        <section class="intro-panel"><p>Some are extraordinary bows, swords, maces, spears, and other sacred weapons bestowed upon great heroes by gods, celestial beings, or revered sages.</p><p>Though not usually invoked through mantras like Astras, nor counted among the eternal Ayudhas of the gods, they remain some of the most celebrated weapons in Hindu sacred literature.</p></section>
        {weaponGroups.map((group) => (
          <section class="weapon-group"><header><span>{group.number}</span><div><p class="eyebrow">Epic weapon category</p><h2>{group.title}</h2><p>{group.note}</p></div></header><div class="weapon-table" role="table" aria-label={group.title}><div class="table-row table-head" role="row">{group.columns.map((column) => <span role="columnheader">{column}</span>)}</div>{group.rows.map((row) => <div class="table-row" role="row">{row.map((cell) => <span role="cell">{cell}</span>)}</div>)}</div></section>
        ))}
        <section class="intro-panel"><p>These legendary weapons are remembered not because of the destruction they caused, but because of the heroes who wielded them.</p><p>The Kodanda evokes the unwavering righteousness of Rama. The Gandiva became a symbol of Arjuna's duty on the battlefield of Kurukshetra. The Vijaya reflected Karna's unmatched skill and determination. The Chandrahasa stood as a mark of Shiva's favor toward Ravana.</p><p>Each weapon tells the story of its bearer, reminding us that true greatness lies not in the weapon itself, but in the character of the one who wields it.</p></section>
      </div>
      <aside class="next-panel"><p class="eyebrow">The journey continues</p><h2>The Complete Atlas</h2><p>With Astras, Ayudhas, and the legendary weapons of the epic heroes now before us, the deeper exploration can begin.</p><p>Each chapter can uncover the origin, powers, scriptural references, notable wielders, famous battles, and enduring significance of these extraordinary weapons.</p><a href="/astras">Back to overview</a></aside>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :global(body:has(.weapon-page)) {
    background: light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 1), #02070b);
    color: light-dark(rgb(43 33 24 / 1), #fff4df);
  }

  :global(body:has(.weapon-page)::before) {
    display: none;
  }

  .weapon-page {
    min-height: 100svh;
    padding: clamp(.75rem, 1.4vw, 1.15rem) 0 5rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 76% 2%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 18%, transparent), transparent 30rem),
      radial-gradient(circle at 12% 44%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--warm) 10%, transparent), transparent 24rem),
      linear-gradient(180deg, light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 1), #02070b), light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 1), #061014) 42%, light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 1), #02070b));
  }

  .weapon-hero,
  .weapon-progress,
  .weapon-layout {
    width: min(1500px, calc(100% - 2rem));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .weapon-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: clamp(34rem, 68svh, 48rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 34%, transparent);
    border-radius: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 2rem);
    background: light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 1), #02070b);
    isolation: isolate;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / .03), 0 30px 90px light-dark(rgb(91 69 38 / 0.126), rgb(0 0 0 / .36));
  }

  .weapon-hero::before {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -2;
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 0.96), rgb(2 7 11 / .96)), light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 0.6), rgb(2 7 11 / .6)) 36%, light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 0.12), rgb(2 7 11 / .12)) 68%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 0.2), rgb(2 7 11 / .2)), transparent 46%, light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 0.88), rgb(2 7 11 / .88))),
      var(--hero-image);
    background-position: center, center, center;
    background-size: cover, cover, cover;
    content: "";
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  .weapon-hero::after {
    position: absolute;
    inset: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
    z-index: -1;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 22%, transparent);
    border-radius: clamp(.9rem, 1.6vw, 1.45rem);
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, light-dark(rgb(99 76 44 / 0.035), rgb(255 255 255 / .035)), transparent 34%, transparent 66%, light-dark(rgb(99 76 44 / 0.025), rgb(255 255 255 / .025))),
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 7.8rem, light-dark(rgb(99 76 44 / 0.025), rgb(255 255 255 / .025)) 7.8rem 7.86rem);
    content: "";
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-glass {
    display: grid;
    width: min(48rem, 52%);
    min-height: calc(100% - clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem));
    align-content: end;
    gap: .9rem;
    margin: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
    padding: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    border-radius: clamp(.95rem, 1.6vw, 1.4rem);
    background:
      linear-gradient(145deg, light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 0.76), rgb(2 7 11 / .76)), light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 0.32), rgb(2 7 11 / .32))),
      radial-gradient(circle at 18% 12%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 22%, transparent), transparent 48%);
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / .08), 0 24px 80px light-dark(rgb(91 69 38 / 0.098), rgb(0 0 0 / .28));
    backdrop-filter: blur(22px) saturate(128%);
  }

  .back-link,
  .progress-item,
  .next-panel a {
    transition: transform .22s ease, border-color .22s ease, background .22s ease, color .22s ease;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    width: fit-content;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .5rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 38%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: .55rem .78rem;
    background: light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 0.42), rgb(2 7 11 / .42));
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 72%, light-dark(rgb(43 33 24 / 1), #fff4df));
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .back-link:hover,
  .progress-item:hover,
  .next-panel a:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 64%, transparent);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 72%, light-dark(rgb(43 33 24 / 1), #fff4df));
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: .18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1,
  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: light-dark(rgb(43 33 24 / 1), #fff4df);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: .98;
  }

  .hero-glass h1 {
    max-width: 11ch;
    font-size: clamp(3.8rem, 6.3vw, 7rem);
    text-shadow: 0 14px 40px light-dark(rgb(91 69 38 / 0.193), rgb(0 0 0 / .55));
  }

  .hero-glass strong {
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--warm) 74%, light-dark(rgb(43 33 24 / 1), #fff4df));
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.7vw, 1.65rem);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero-glass p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: light-dark(rgb(91 76 57 / 1), #eee0ca);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.15vw, 1.14rem);
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  .weapon-progress {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: .85rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: clamp(.9rem, 1.6vw, 1.25rem);
    border: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(118 93 55 / 0.09), rgb(255 255 255 / .09));
    border-radius: 1.15rem;
    padding: .75rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, light-dark(rgb(99 76 44 / 0.06), rgb(255 255 255 / .06)), light-dark(rgb(99 76 44 / 0.025), rgb(255 255 255 / .025)));
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / .05), 0 18px 46px light-dark(rgb(91 69 38 / 0.07), rgb(0 0 0 / .2));
  }

  .progress-head {
    display: grid;
    min-width: 9.5rem;
    border-right: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(118 93 55 / 0.1), rgb(255 255 255 / .1));
    padding: .15rem 1rem .15rem .35rem;
  }

  .progress-head span {
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 70%, light-dark(rgb(43 33 24 / 1), #fff4df));
    font-size: .58rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .progress-head strong {
    margin-top: .12rem;
    color: light-dark(rgb(43 33 24 / 1), #fff4df);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .weapon-progress > div:last-child {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: .55rem;
  }

  .progress-item {
    display: grid;
    min-width: 0;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: .12rem .55rem;
    border: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(118 93 55 / 0.09), rgb(255 255 255 / .09));
    border-radius: .95rem;
    padding: .62rem .72rem .62rem .55rem;
    background: light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 0.45), rgb(2 7 11 / .45));
    color: light-dark(rgb(43 33 24 / 1), #fff4df);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .progress-item.active {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 54%, transparent);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 18%, transparent), light-dark(rgb(99 76 44 / 0.035), rgb(255 255 255 / .035)));
  }

  .progress-item > span {
    display: grid;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    grid-row: 1 / 3;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 18%, light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 1), #0a0f10));
    color: light-dark(rgb(43 33 24 / 1), #fff4df);
    font-size: .62rem;
    font-weight: 950;
  }

  .progress-item strong,
  .progress-item small {
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .progress-item strong {
    font-size: .76rem;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .progress-item small {
    color: light-dark(rgb(91 76 57 / 1), #d9c7a8);
    font-size: .56rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .weapon-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(18rem, 24rem);
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 2rem);
    margin-top: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.7rem);
  }

  .weapon-groups {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.35rem);
  }

  .intro-panel,
  .weapon-group,
  .next-panel {
    border: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(118 93 55 / 0.08), rgb(255 255 255 / .08));
    border-radius: 1.35rem;
    background:
      linear-gradient(145deg, light-dark(rgb(99 76 44 / 0.055), rgb(255 255 255 / .055)), light-dark(rgb(99 76 44 / 0.018), rgb(255 255 255 / .018))),
      linear-gradient(180deg, light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 0.78), rgb(2 7 11 / .78)), light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 0.58), rgb(2 7 11 / .58)));
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / .055), 0 22px 70px light-dark(rgb(91 69 38 / 0.063), rgb(0 0 0 / .18));
  }

  .intro-panel {
    padding: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
    color: light-dark(rgb(91 76 57 / 1), #eadfcc);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.08vw, 1.08rem);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .intro-panel p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .intro-panel p + p {
    margin-top: .85rem;
  }

  .weapon-group {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .weapon-group::before {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 auto 0 0;
    width: .22rem;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--accent), transparent);
    content: "";
    opacity: .7;
  }

  .weapon-group header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.55rem);
  }

  .weapon-group header > span {
    display: grid;
    width: 3.1rem;
    height: 3.1rem;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 38%, transparent);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 32% 28%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 34%, transparent), transparent 56%),
      light-dark(rgb(99 76 44 / 0.04), rgb(255 255 255 / .04));
    color: light-dark(rgb(43 33 24 / 1), #fff4df);
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 950;
  }

  .weapon-group h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 2.35vw, 2.45rem);
  }

  .weapon-group header p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 74ch;
    margin: .72rem 0 0;
    color: light-dark(rgb(91 76 57 / 1), #e8decc);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .weapon-table {
    display: grid;
    margin: 0 clamp(.7rem, 1.4vw, 1rem) clamp(.7rem, 1.4vw, 1rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(118 93 55 / 0.07), rgb(255 255 255 / .07));
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 0.45), rgb(1 6 9 / .45));
  }

  .table-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, .9fr) minmax(10rem, .82fr) minmax(14rem, 1.2fr);
  }

  .table-row span {
    min-width: 0;
    border-right: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(118 93 55 / 0.07), rgb(255 255 255 / .07));
    border-bottom: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(118 93 55 / 0.07), rgb(255 255 255 / .07));
    padding: .9rem 1rem;
    color: light-dark(rgb(91 76 57 / 1), #e8decc);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .table-row span:first-child {
    color: light-dark(rgb(43 33 24 / 1), #fff4df);
    font-weight: 850;
  }

  .table-row span:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  .table-row:last-child span {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .table-head span {
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 72%, light-dark(rgb(43 33 24 / 1), #fff4df));
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 10%, transparent);
    font-size: .64rem;
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: .13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .next-panel {
    position: sticky;
    top: 6rem;
    align-self: start;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.55rem);
  }

  .next-panel::before {
    display: block;
    height: 13rem;
    margin: calc(clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.55rem) * -1) calc(clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.55rem) * -1) 1.1rem;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, light-dark(rgb(247 240 226 / 0.88), rgb(2 7 11 / .88))),
      var(--hero-image);
    background-position: center;
    background-size: cover;
    content: "";
  }

  .next-panel h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 2.5vw, 2.55rem);
  }

  .next-panel p {
    color: light-dark(rgb(91 76 57 / 1), #e8decc);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .next-panel a {
    display: inline-flex;
    margin-top: .4rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 40%, transparent);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: .58rem .85rem;
    color: #05090a;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--warm));
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1060px) {
    .hero-glass {
      width: auto;
      margin-top: clamp(11rem, 28svh, 18rem);
    }

    .weapon-progress,
    .weapon-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .progress-head {
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid light-dark(rgb(118 93 55 / 0.1), rgb(255 255 255 / .1));
      padding-bottom: .65rem;
    }

    .next-panel {
      position: relative;
      top: auto;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .weapon-page {
      padding-bottom: 6rem;
    }

    .weapon-hero,
    .weapon-progress,
    .weapon-layout {
      width: min(100% - 1rem, 1500px);
    }

    .weapon-hero {
      min-height: 40rem;
    }

    .hero-glass {
      margin: clamp(10rem, 28svh, 13rem) .7rem .7rem;
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .hero-glass h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 15vw, 4.4rem);
    }

    .weapon-progress > div:last-child {
      display: flex;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }

    .weapon-progress > div:last-child::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }

    .progress-item {
      min-width: 11rem;
    }

    .weapon-group header {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .table-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .table-head {
      display: none;
    }

    .table-row span {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(7.2rem, .42fr) 1fr;
      gap: .75rem;
      border-right: 0;
    }

    .table-row span::before {
      color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 76%, light-dark(rgb(43 33 24 / 1), #fff4df));
      font-size: .62rem;
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      content: "Weapon";
    }

    .table-row span:nth-child(2)::before {
      content: "Hero";
    }

    .table-row span:nth-child(3)::before {
      content: "Origin";
    }
  }
</style>
